Day 11 – Change Ownership

# What I Learned
  - Change Ownership
  
# Commands Practiced
  - `sudo chown user file_or_folder_name.txt`        / change ownership of file  to another user
  - `sudo chown user:user filename.txt`              / change owner and group owner to another user
  - `sudo chown :user filename.txt`                  / change group ownership only
  - `sudo chown -R user foldername`                  / change permission recurssively for folder and everything inside it
  
# Problems I Faced
  - I didnot know how to change only group permission
  
# How I Fixed Them
  - used :user instead of user:user
